essment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn10le15ob10re2vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hi Ms. Moore, you wanted to see me?<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Yes, Adam. Please, have a seat. <br/>It's been brought to my attention that you are disturbing the work of others.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm not quite sure I know what you're getting at, Ms. Moore.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Many of your co-workers have voiced their concerns about your behavior lately. While I appreciate all you've done for the office, making it more ergonomically friendly, you mustn't be taking up the time of others.", "id": 1, "time": "3000"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Could you elaborate on that please? I don't think I've wasted anyone's time. In fact, I even came up with cost-effective methods.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: That's not what I was saying, Adam. Before we continue, we need to come to a mutual understanding. I need not be questioned about my decision.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes, I agree. Also, have you had a chance to read the action plan I put together?<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Not yet, Adam. What I'm saying is: you needn't spend too much time on these reports of yours. You must ensure that you're completing the tasks at hand. Once they're completed, then you can spend more time on this. Are you following what I'm saying?", "id": 2, "time": "39000"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes, I understand. I'm sorry, Ms. Moore. I had no idea it was this big of a deal.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Adam, what you're doing ... what you've done is fantastic. You've taken it upon yourself to improve the office's environment and ergonomics. You mustn't be discouraged by this chat. I think you need to continue with this.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: So, what you're saying is I must not let it interfere with my job?<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Exactly.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Thanks, Ms. Moore.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Have a good day, Adam.", "id": 3, "time": "82700"}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Issues in the Workplace", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Ergonomic Workplaces", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Analyze issues relating to different topics and their solution in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ergonomically friendly ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u200bdesigned in a way that makes it comfortable and \u200beffective for \u200bpeople who use it for their \u200bwork", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We are trying to make the office more ergonomically friendly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le15ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when talking about the office environment. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cost-effective", "type": "name"}, {"content": "good \u200bvalue for the \u200bamount of \u200bmoney \u200bpaid", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I even came up with cost effective methods.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le15ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mutual understanding ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a \u200binformal \u200bagreement between \u200btwo or more people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Before we continue, we need to come to a mutual understanding. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le15ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "action plan", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sequence of steps that must be taken, for a strategy to succeed. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Also, have you had a chance to read the action plan I put together?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le15ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "environment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the people and things that are around you in your life", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You've taken it upon yourself to improve the office's environment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le15ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ergonomics", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way in which the careful design of equipment helps people to work better and more quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We ought to improve the ergonomics. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le15ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Modals of Necessity and Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to talk about things that need to be done or when you want to give advice to coworkers, you can use some particular modal verbs to communicate your ideas.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class = \"bullet\"> You use the modals<span class=\"strong\"> must</span>, <span class=\"strong\">need</span> and their negatives <span class=\"strong\">mustn't</span> and<span class=\"strong\"> needn't </span>to talk about what is necessary and not necessary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class = \"bullet\"> You use <span class=\"strong\">must</span> or <span class=\"strong\">need</span> when something is necessary to be done.    </br>For example: <span class=\"italic\"> The article has many mistakes. You <span class=\"strong\">must</span> check it/  you <span class=\"strong\">need </span> to check it. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class = \"bullet\"> You use <span class=\"strong\">mustn't</span> when something is prohibited.</br> For example:</br><span class=\"italic\">  You <span class=\"strong\">mustn't</span> smoke here. We are in a hospital.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class = \"bullet\"> You use<span class=\"strong\"> needn't </span> when there is not necessity of doing something.</br>  For example:  </br><span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">needn't come to lunch if you don't want to.</span> (You don't have to come to lunch, but if you do is okay)</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class = \"bullet\"> The modals<span class=\"strong\"> should</span> or <span class=\"strong\">ought to</span>  can be used to give <span class=\"underline\">advice</span>.  </br>For example:</br>  <span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\"> should </span>do exercise every day. It is good for your health.</br> You <span class=\"strong\">ought to </span>change the style of chair you have. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You mustn't be taking away time from your co-workers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We need to come to a mutual understanding. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You needn't spend too much time with these reports of yours. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You mustn't be discouraged by this chat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I need not be questioned about my decision.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You ought to read through the action plan.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "What is an Ergonomic Office Environment?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Ergonomics is the how the design of a workplace affects the productivity of its employees.</br> Improving ergonomics in the office is not difficult, and provides great benefits: An increase in employee comfort and productivity equals a lower risk for work-related injuries. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are some tips on how to make your workplace more ergonomically-focused:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Understand what kind of injuries related to ergonomics exist (muscular disorders) </li> <li> Identify current and potential issues in the workplace that can cause ergonomic injuries </li> <li> Set up your workstation to optimize your equipment and to minimize any potential injuries. </li> <li> Select the right kind equipment (chair, desk, lighting etc.)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I can identify ways to make a room ergonomically friendly.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I can express what is necessary and not necessary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write an action plan. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Look around your classroom or workplace. Write down 7-10 ways you think your classroom or workplace can be made more ergonomically friendly. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose 2-3 of the things you wrote down. Come up with an action plan to put your suggestions into motion. Remember to include what is necessary and not necessary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your action plan. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read it aloud to your class. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le15ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}]}